            "review_text": "Bao T\n2 contributions\n0\nExcellent dinner in Ha Long\nNov 2024 • Family\nFood and service here is top notch. I had their beef pho for dinner. I would have taken a picture of the pho, but I ate it quickly. Very tasty. I also had a dragon fruit drink. Also very tasty. I got it without ice. It was warm just how I like my drinks. I would highly recommend coming here for dinner.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 3, 2024",
