            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Ngọc Mai",
            "review_text": "Passport39390297473\n2 contributions\n0\nWonderful time with excellent service\nOct 2024 • Family\nMy family had perfect buffet in Ngoc Mai restaurant on mid-autumn festival day. The restaurant is in Best Western 5 star hotel which is luxury with nice decorations. We was impressed since we get into lobby - super magnificent. Then we reached the restaurant and was stunned by the buffet set up. Food look so delicious and food was so diverse and rich. Especially, there was kid corner which made my kids happy. Last but not least, the staffs here were amazing. They take care us so well and they help me carry my 8 month baby, then I can enjoy the meal comfortably. With all above service, the price is too reasonable. 10 score is not enough for them. We definitely be back soon.\nLilly\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nHighly recommend for everyone\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 31, 2024\nWanderer06903149046\nWe thank you for your honest reviews about the restaurant. On behalf of the restaurant staff, I would like to thank you very much and see you again. Thanks a lot\nRead more\nWritten November 26, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
